 case report and literature review</article-title><source>Int J Cardiol</source><year>2007</year><volume>115</volume><fpage>e94</fpage><lpage>e96</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17126927</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B7"><label>7</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Burgner</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Festa</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Issacs</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Delayed diagnosis of Kawasaki disease presenting with massive lymphadenopathy and airway obstruction</article-title><source>BMJ</source><year>1996</year><volume>312</volume><fpage>1471</fpage><lpage>1472</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8664632</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B8"><label>8</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Nagy</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Pizzuto</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Backstrom</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Brodsky</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Deep neck infections in children: a new approach to diagnosis and treatment</article-title><source>Laryngoscope</source><year>1997</year><volume>107</volume><fpage>1627</fpage><lpage>1634</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9396677</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B9"><label>9</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Philpott</surname><given-names>CM</given-names></name><name><surname>Selvadurai</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Banerjee</surname><given-names>AR</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Paediatric retropharyngeal abscess</article-title><source>J Laryngol Otol</source><year>2004</year><volume>118</volume><fpage>919</fpage><lpage>926</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15667676</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B10"><label>10</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Holt</surname><given-names>GR</given-names></name><name><surname>McManus</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Newman</surname><given-names>RK</given-names></name><name><surname>Potter</surname><given-names>JL</given-names></name><name><surname>Tinsley</surname><given-names>PP</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Computed tomography in the diagnosis of deep-neck infections</article-title><source>Arch Otolaryngol</source><year>1982</year><volume>108</volume><fpage>693</fpage><lpage>696</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7138361</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B11"><label>11</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Boucher</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Dorion</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Fisch</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Retropharyngeal abscesses; a clinical and radiologic correlation</article-title><source>J Otolaryngol</source><year>1999</year><volume>28</volume><fpage>134</fpage><lpage>137</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10410343</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B12"><label>12</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Weber</surname><given-names>AL</given-names></name><name><surname>Siciliano</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>CT and MR imaging evaluation of neck infections with clinical correlations</article-title><source>Radiol Clin North Am</source><year>2000</year><volume>38</volume><fpage>941</fpage><lpage>968</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11054962</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B13"><label>13</la